<p id="q30">30. If demand for <strong>auto or credit card loans from prime or subprime borrowers</strong> has <strong>weakened <em>this year</em></strong>, how important have been the following reasons for the change? (Please respond to each question as appropriate.)  </p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

